			"widgets_values":[
				"**Prompt (English):**\n9:16 vertical premium commercial poster, merging \"Spring Floral\" aesthetic with \"Modern Tech\" product. The background is a clear, bright light blue sky with soft, airy clouds. In the center, a beautiful 18-year-old Chinese girl with stylish short hair (bob cut) and a radiant smile, wearing a minimalist white camisole. She is wearing the LINKLIKE open-ear headphones. The foreground is filled with vibrant, out-of-focus spring flowers including pink poppies, purple lavender, and white daisies, creating a lush depth of field. A sleek, white minimalist arched frame stands behind the girl. Several glowing blue butterflies flutter around her. Natural, soft high-key lighting with a professional studio finish.\n\n**Product Display (Strictly Restore Uploaded Image):** \nThe LINKLIKE open-ear headphones must be featured prominently. One earbud is worn naturally on the girl's ear, while the other earbud and the sleek metallic charging case float artistically near her hand. \n- **Product Details:** Metallic silver and matte black finish, ergonomic ear-hook design.\n- **Brand Logo:** The \"LINKLIKE\" logo must be clearly visible on the side of the earbuds and the center of the charging case.\n- **Texture:** High-end metallic luster with realistic light reflections, contrasting against the soft floral environment.\n\n**Layout (Bilingual Chinese-English Design):**\n\n**Top Center:**\n- **Main Title (Bold stylized font, Stacked Layout):**\n  - Line 1: \"悦听春日\" (Pure white, thick bold sans-serif, size 25% of canvas width)\n  - Line 2: \"SPRING SYMPHONY\" (Bright lime green #B6FF00, thin sans-serif, size 50% of Chinese text)\n- **Sub-headline (Directly below):**\n  - \"理想生活，从好声音开始 / Ideal life starts with great sound\" (White, clean Song font, small size)\n\n**Top Left:**\n- **Brand Logo:** LINKLIKE (Minimalist black/white logo, 5% canvas width)\n\n**Center Right (Floating near the product):**\n- **Glassmorphism Info Tags (Semi-transparent white, bilingual):**\n  - \"不入耳更舒适 / Open-Ear Comfort\"\n  - \"大师级音质 / Pro Sound Quality\"\n\n**Bottom Area:**\n- **Search Bar UI (Tmall Style):** A dark grey rounded search bar with text \"LINKLIKE官方旗舰店\" and a magnifying glass icon.\n- **Campaign Info:** \"3/21-3/24 新美力周 | 把春天寄给你 / Send Spring to You\" (White text, centered).\n\n**Bottom Right:**\n- **CTA Button (Rounded Pill, Lime Green #B6FF00 background, Black text):**\n  - \"立即选购 SHOP NOW →\" (Bold, 12pt font)\n\n**Color Palette:**\n- **Primary:** Sky Blue (#87CEEB), Petal Pink (#FFB6C1)\n- **Accent:** Lime Green (#B6FF00), Metallic Silver (#C0C0C0)\n- **Text:** Pure White (#FFFFFF) for readability against the bright background."
